r them down in a controlled manner  and repeat this exercise targets  especially the lower abs and also hip  flexors if you're struggling to keep  your legs straight you can always start  by bending your knees slightly and then  progress so these are seven of my  favorite core exercises which I like to  do in the gym to give me a strong and  rock solid core what are your favorite  core exercises let me know in the  comments below you might find yourself  struggling to begin with but that's okay  stop any meet - but get back into the  workout and finish it start without any  weights if you need to and as you  progress challenge yourself by adding  some intensity so do these exercises at  least two to three times weekly and you  can combine it with my other total body  workouts don't forget to hit the  subscribe button for more workout videos  recipes and also fitness tips and do  check out the videos right here as well  all the best

